# php-7.0-enhanced-remicollet.patch
# CVE-2026-109618 / CVE-2026-109619 ("php2shell") backport for Remi Collet's
# PHP 7.0 security tree (remicollet/php-src-security, branch PHP-7.0-security-backports)
#
# Tailored for Remi Collet's backport branch:
#  - Accommodates pre-existing max_multipart_body_parts INI & body parts count logic
#  - Accommodates Remi's !Z_ISUNDEF(progress->data) guard in MULTIPART_EVENT_END
#  - Bundles pre-generated ext/standard/var_unserializer.c (no re2c version mismatch)
#  - Applies cleanly with 0 rejects: patch -p1 < php-7.0-enhanced-remicollet.patch
#
